'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page one of the [[Righteous Revenants Legendary Warbond#Page 1|Righteous Revenants]] Premium [[Warbond]], can be claimed separately for {{Currency|Medals|8|notext}} and 2 [[Medal]]s.

== Trivia ==
*Part of the content released in collaboration with ''Killzone 2'' for their crossover.
*The name of this cosmetic set, as well as the [[Defender of Our Dream]] cosmetic set, are both references to the speech of [https://killzone.fandom.com/wiki/Scolar_Visari Scolar Visari] from the intro cutscene of the first ''Killzone'' game.
*The [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]] could previously be bought from the ‘Premium [[Superstore]]’ for a whopping {{Currency|SC|310|notext}} and 90 [[Super Credits]], respectively! Later on these items were bundled together into the [[Righteous Revenants Legendary Warbond]].
**The items in this Premium Superstore rotation were originally scheduled to be removed after five days; however, due to player concerns over missing out ({{Tooltip|FOMO|Fear of Missing Out}}), the developers extended their availability to ten days.

